iller, Compact, Contract, Covenant","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2009,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_miller_2009"],"support":"Library and retailer records (University of Toronto Press, 2009); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_mawani_2009","label":"Mawani, Colonial Proximities","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2009,"month":5,"day":15,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_mawani_2009"],"support":"UBC Press page (hardcover 15 May 2009); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"event_76b95a41b831","label":"Veracini, Settler Colonialism","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2010,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_veracini_2010"],"support":"Date retained from the existing entry/bibliographic evidence. See the cited source records for their original reading and metadata limits.","basis":"existing_entry_and_bibliography"},{"id":"sc_byrd_2011","label":"Byrd, The Transit of Empire","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2011,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_byrd_2011"],"support":"Metadata only (existing record); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"event_bcc856937341","label":"Introducing Settler Colonial Studies","kind":"first_issue","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2011,"month":1,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_veracini_2011","graph:p4b_veracini_2011_deposit","graph:screq_snelgrove_dhamoon_corntassel_2014"],"support":"Veracini's \"Introducing settler colonial studies\" read in full (author's deposit): open access, \"entirely run on volunteer labour\" (Snelgrove et al. 2014, p. 9), ARC grant DP0986984; Crossref issued January 2011.","basis":"existing_entry_and_bibliography"},{"id":"sc_wolfe_after_frontier_2011","label":"Wolfe, \"After the Frontier\" (Settler Colonial Studies 1:1)","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2011,"month":1,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_wolfe_2011_after_frontier"],"support":"Crossref (January 2011); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_regan_2011","label":"Regan, Unsettling the Settler Within (paperback; EPUB December 2010)","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2011,"month":1,"day":25,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_regan_2010"],"support":"UBC Press page: EPUB 22 December 2010, paperback 25 January 2011; unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_wolfe_purchase_2012","label":"Wolfe, \"Purchase by Other Means\"; Arabic translation of the 2006 essay (Settler Colonial Studies 2:1)","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2012,"month":1,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_wolfe_2012_purchase","graph:p4b_wolfe_2012_arabic"],"support":"Crossref (January 2012); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_tuck_yang_2012","label":"Tuck and Yang, \"Decolonization is not a metaphor\"","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2012,"month":9,"day":8,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_tuck_yang_2012"],"support":"Journal page: published 2012-09-08; read in most pages.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_macoun_strakosch_2013","label":"Macoun and Strakosch, \"The ethical demands of settler colonial theory\"","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2013,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_macoun_strakosch_2013","graph:p4b_macoun_strakosch_2013_qut"],"support":"Authors' version read; SCS 3:3–4 (2013).","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_daschuk_2013","label":"Daschuk, Clearing the Plains","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2013,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_daschuk_2013","graph:p4b_daschuk_urp_2019"],"support":"Crossref (De Gruyter) issues the DOI 2013-12-31; publisher page; unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_journal_tandf_2013","label":"Settler Colonial Studies moves to Taylor & Francis","kind":"institution_change","track":"context","date":{"year":2013,"month":2,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_edmonds_carey_2013","graph:screq_snelgrove_dhamoon_corntassel_2014"],"support":"Edmonds and Carey, \"A new beginning for Settler Colonial Studies\" (SCS 3:1, Crossref, February 2013; unread); Snelgrove et al. 2014, p. 9 (read): moved \"to a large academic publishing house, Taylor & Francis, within two years of being established\".","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_veracini_career_2013","label":"Veracini, \"'Settler Colonialism': Career of a Concept\"","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2013,"month":3,"day":25,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_veracini_2013","graph:p4b_veracini_2013_deposit"],"support":"Online 25 March 2013 (publisher page capture); author manuscript read in part.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_wolfe_binarism_2013","label":"Wolfe, ed., \"Recuperating Binarism\" (Settler Colonial Studies 3:3–4) with the paired AICRJ 37:2","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2013,"month":11,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_wolfe_2013_recuperating"],"support":"Crossref (November 2013); Snelgrove et al. 2014, p. 10 (read); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_snelgrove_2014","label":"Snelgrove, Dhamoon and Corntassel, \"Unsettling settler colonialism\"","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2014,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_snelgrove_dhamoon_corntassel_2014"],"support":"Journal PDF (Decolonization 3:2, pp. 1–32); read in most pages.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_rowse_2014","label":"Rowse, \"Indigenous Heterogeneity\"","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2014,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_rowse_2014"],"support":"Abstract (existing record).","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_mccallum_2014","label":"McCallum, Indigenous Women, Work, and History","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2014,"month":5,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_mccallum_2014"],"support":"Publisher page (May 2014); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_simpson_mohawk_2014","label":"A. Simpson, Mohawk Interruptus","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2014,"month":5,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_a_simpson_2014"],"support":"Duke University Press page (May 2014); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_coulthard_2014","label":"Coulthard, Red Skin, White Masks","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2014,"month":8,"day":15,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_coulthard_2014"],"support":"Minnesota page: eBook 15 August 2014, paperback 7 September 2014; Crossref; unread (p. 125 as quoted by Englert).","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_veracini_present_2015","label":"Veracini, The Settler Colonial Present","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2015,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_veracini_2015"],"support":"Crossref (Palgrave 2015); unread; passages as quoted by Englert 2020.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_asa_panel_2015","label":"ASA panel \"The Settler Colonialism Analytic: A Critical Reappraisal\"; Warrior's position paper on the field and NAIS","kind":"lecture_delivery","track":"context","date":{"year":2015,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_kauanui_2016"],"support":"Kauanui 2016, paras 5–6 (read in full).","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_perry_2015","label":"Perry, Colonial Relations","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2015,"month":4,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_perry_2015"],"support":"Cambridge Core page (2 April and 5 May 2015); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_moreton_robinson_2015","label":"Moreton-Robinson, The White Possessive","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2015,"month":5,"day":15,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_moreton_robinson_2015"],"support":"Minnesota page (15 May 2015); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_trc_summary_2015","label":"TRC Summary: residential schools \"can best be described as 'cultural genocide'\"","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2015,"month":6,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_trc_summary_2015","graph:p4b_pm_backgrounder_2015"],"support":"Summary pp. 1–3 read; released \"at the Closing Event in Ottawa in June 2015\" (Prime Minister's backgrounder, read).","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_lowman_barker_2015","label":"Battell Lowman and Barker, Settler","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2015,"month":10,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_battell_lowman_barker_2015"],"support":"Fernwood page (October 2015); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_trc_final_2015","label":"TRC final report presented at the Commission's final event","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2015,"month":12,"day":15,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_pm_backgrounder_2015"],"support":"Prime Minister's backgrounder dated 15 December 2015 (read).","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_wolfe_traces_complex_2016","label":"Wolfe, Traces of History; ed., The Settler Complex","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2016,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_wolfe_2016","graph:p4b_wolfe_traces_bl_2016","graph:p4b_wolfe_settler_complex_2016"],"support":"British Library record (electronic edition seen 27 January 2016); Goeman 2016, note 6; both unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_kauanui_2016","label":"Kauanui, \"'A Structure, Not an Event'\" (Lateral 5:1)","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2016,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_kauanui_2016"],"support":"Read in full; Spring 2016 issue.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_wolfe_death_2016","label":"Patrick Wolfe dies, Melbourne","kind":"death","track":"context","date":{"year":2016,"month":2,"day":18,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_goeman_2016","graph:p4b_veracini_wolfe_obituary_2016"],"support":"Goeman's title \"(February 18, 2016)\" (read); Wikidata Q109284663 P570 2016-02-18, P20 Melbourne (QLever).","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_veracini_obituary_2016","label":"Veracini, obituary of Wolfe (Settler Colonial Studies 6:3)","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2016,"month":5,"day":10,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_veracini_wolfe_obituary_2016"],"support":"Read in full; Crossref online 10 May 2016.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_handbook_2016","label":"Cavanagh and Veracini, eds., The Routledge Handbook of the History of Settler Colonialism (online; print 2017)","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2016,"month":8,"day":12,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_cavanagh_veracini_2017"],"support":"Crossref book DOI issued 12 August 2016; unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_carter_imperial_plots_2016","label":"Carter, Imperial Plots","kind":"publication","track":"context","date":{"year":2016,"month":10,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_carter_2016"],"support":"Publisher page (October 2016); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_lateral_responses_2017","label":"Jafri and Gniadek respond to Kauanui, with her reply (Lateral 6:1)","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2017,"month":5,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_jafri_2017"],"support":"Crossref (May 2017); editors' note on Kauanui's page; unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"sc_hugill_2017","label":"Hugill, \"What is a settler-colonial city?\"","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2017,"month"