ch, \"Good Patrick\" (Aboriginal History 40)","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2016,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_birch_2016"],"support":"Victoria University repository record; unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"pw_traces_2016","label":"Traces of History: Elementary Structures of Race (Verso)","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":2016,"month":1,"precision":"month","qualifier":"electronic edition seen January 2016; print date not seen"},"source_ids":["graph:screq_wolfe_2016","graph:p4b_wolfe_traces_bl_2016","graph:p4b_goeman_2016"],"support":"British Library record: electronic edition \"viewed January 27, 2016\"; Goeman: released \"around the same time as his passing\". Print date not seen.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"pw_death_2016","label":"Death, Melbourne","kind":"death","track":"context","date":{"year":2016,"month":2,"day":18,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_goeman_2016"],"support":"Goeman's title \"(February 18, 2016)\" (read); Wikidata Q109284663 P570/P20 (QLever, 2026-10-23).","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"pw_veracini_obituary_2016","label":"Veracini, \"Patrick Wolfe (1949–2016)\" (Settler Colonial Studies 6:3)","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2016,"month":5,"day":10,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_veracini_wolfe_obituary_2016"],"support":"Read in full; Crossref online 10 May 2016.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"pw_reviews_ahs_2017","label":"Makdisi and Smithers review Traces of History and The Settler Complex (Australian Historical Studies 48:1)","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2017,"month":1,"day":2,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_makdisi_2017_ahs","graph:p4b_smithers_2017_ahs"],"support":"Crossref (2 January 2017); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"pw_aq_forum_2017","label":"American Quarterly forum \"Tracing the Settler's Tools: A Forum on Patrick Wolfe's Life and Legacy\"","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2017,"month":6,"precision":"month"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_aq_forum_2017","graph:p4b_kelley_2017"],"support":"Crossref (June 2017); unread.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"pw_englert_2020","label":"Englert, \"Settlers, Workers, and the Logic of Accumulation by Dispossession\"","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2020,"month":7,"day":20,"precision":"day"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_englert_2020"],"support":"Read in full; Wiley first published 20 July 2020.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"},{"id":"pw_festschrift_2022","label":"Race, Place, Trace: Essays in Honour of Patrick Wolfe (eds Slyomovics and Veracini, Verso)","kind":"reception_publication","track":"reception","date":{"year":2022,"precision":"year","qualifier":"dated from the publisher's blog excerpt of 22 September 2022; imprint date not seen"},"source_ids":["graph:p4b_russell_verso_2022"],"support":"Verso blog excerpt dated 22 September 2022; imprint date not seen.","basis":"period4_wave1_reading"}],"intervals":[],"continuation":{"status":"not_asserted","basis":"No continuous historical duration or ending is established by this selection."},"interpretation":"The three events of revision 1.141 are kept with their ids. Additions rest on data/extension-2026/period4-wave1-2026-10-23/evidence-settler-colonial.md §§1, 5, 12, 13 and P.7: the 2006 essay read in full; the other works dated from Crossref, the Berghahn page, the British Library record and the Victoria University guide, and marked unread where they are; reception events from texts read in full (Veracini, Goeman, Kauanui, Macoun and Strakosch, Snelgrove et al., Englert) or Crossref.","prepared_on":"2026-10-23","editorial_record":"data/production-batches/group-revision-1.156/acceptance.json"},"reason":"Period-4 wave 1, 2026-10-23 (data/extension-2026/period4-wave1-2026-10-23/evidence-settler-colonial.md) P.7: three existing events kept with their ids (support revised); 21 events added, 1994–2022 (13 contributions, 1 death, 10 reception)."},{"node":"patrick_wolfe","field":"date_label","expect":"Settler Colonialism and the Transformation of Anthropology 1999 · later essays 2001, 2006","value":"'Nation and MiscegeNation' 1994 · Settler Colonialism and the Transformation of Anthropology 1999 · 'Land, Labor, and Difference' 2001 · 'Settler Colonialism and the Elimination of the Native' 2006 · 'Structure and Event' 2008 · Settler Colonial Studies essays 2011–15 · Traces of History and The Settler Complex 2016 · d. 2016 · forum 2017 · Festschrift 2022","reason":"Legacy provenance label updated to match the chronology."},{"node":"environment","field":"date_label","expect":"1970s consolidation","value":"1970s consolidation · Environmental History (journal) 1996 · NiCHE 2004 · Canadian number of Environmental History 2007 · Sutter forum 2013 · Oxford Handbook 2014 · reviewed through 2024","reason":"Period-4 wave 1 (data/extension-2026/period4-wave1-2026-10-23/evidence-environment.md) P1: dated milestones; coverage stated."},{"node":"environment","field":"coverage","expect":{"reviewed_through":2000,"basis":"Reviewed through 2000 in the original 1920–2000 experiment. Later work is not yet surveyed for this entry; selected later interventions, where present, are dated individually."},"value":{"reviewed_through":2024,"basis":"Reviewed through 2000 in the original 1920–2000 experiment; extended to 2024 on 2026-10-23 (data/extension-2026/period4-wave1-2026-10-23/evidence-environment.md) on the wilderness debate (Foreman 2000 read in full; the 1996 journal comments unread), the field's surveys (McNeill 2003 from the earlier record; Sutter 2013 by the editors' summary and abstract; Isenberg 2014 by abstract and contents), the Canadian field (NiCHE and UBC Press pages, publisher pages and abstracts 2001–2019) and the Anthropocene histories (publisher descriptions). The History PhD citation graph, release 2026-10-23 gives the readership: 5.7% of Canada + US theses cited two or more of the field's authors in 2000–09, 9.5% in 2010–14, 11.3% in 2015–19, 9.9% in 2020–25 (Canada 10.2%, US 9.7%); the works co-cited with Cronon, Worster, White, Crosby and Merchant peaked in Canada in 2010–14 and halved by 2020–25, the new members being Wolfe and Tuck and Yang; the US network is stable and ageing, its entrants Indigenous, borderlands and slavery works. The later texts named here are dated individually; the bodies of most are unread."},"reason":"Period-4 wave 1 (data/extension-2026/period4-wave1-2026-10-23/evidence-environment.md) P5."},{"node":"environment","field":"chronology","expect":{"version":1,"label":"Selected contributions · 1979–1991","selection_note":"Selected contributions and witnesses, not a field origin, lifespan or complete history.","events":[{"id":"event_8e9099d84ba5","label":"Worster, Dust Bowl","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":1979,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:worster_dust_bowl"],"support":"Date retained from the existing entry/bibliographic evidence. See the cited source records for their original reading and metadata limits.","basis":"existing_entry_and_bibliography"},{"id":"event_efbd8a2df001","label":"Merchant, The Death of Nature","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":1980,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:merchant_death_excerpt"],"support":"Date retained from the existing entry/bibliographic evidence. See the cited source records for their original reading and metadata limits.","basis":"existing_entry_and_bibliography"},{"id":"event_ba35b7748abe","label":"Crosby, Ecological Imperialism","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":1986,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:crosby_ecological"],"support":"Date retained from the existing entry/bibliographic evidence. See the cited source records for their original reading and metadata limits.","b