logy and Foreman's 2000 answer as reception; the 2003 essay and 2013 address as contributions); the 1983, 1991 and 1995 events are unchanged.","prepared_on":"2026-10-23","editorial_record":"data/production-batches/period4-1.156/acceptance.json","retain":["The 1996 response, the 1990 round-table reply and the 2012 columns are unread."],"unresolved":["The ASEH presidency is dated 1989–93 from the CV; the AHA term is 2012–13 (elected 2011)."]},"reason":"Period-4 wave 1 (data/extension-2026/period4-wave1-2026-10-23/evidence-environment.md): dated contributions, reception and context added; the existing events are unchanged."},{"node":"donald_worster","field":"date_label","expect":"Nature's Economy 1977 · Dust Bowl 1979 · Rivers of Empire 1985 · 'Transformations of the Earth' 1990","value":"Nature's Economy 1977 · Dust Bowl 1979 · Rivers of Empire 1985 · 'Transformations of the Earth' 1990 · The Wealth of Nature 1993 · A River Running West 2001 · A Passion for Nature 2008 · Shrinking the Earth 2016","reason":"Legacy label updated to match the chronology."},{"node":"donald_worster","field":"chronology","expect":{"version":1,"label":"Selected contributions · 1979–1990","selection_note":"Selected dated contributions, not career or lifespan boundaries.","events":[{"id":"event_34313521144f","label":"Dust Bowl","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":1979,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:worster_dust_bowl"],"support":"Date retained from the existing entry/bibliographic evidence. See the cited source records for their original reading and metadata limits.","basis":"existing_entry_and_bibliography"},{"id":"event_99051472c001","label":"Transformations of the Earth","kind":"publication","track":"contributions","date":{"year":1990,"precision":"year"},"source_ids":["graph:pe131_worster_jah_1990"],"support":"Date retained from the existing entry/bibliographic evidence. See the cited source records for their original reading and metadata limits.","basis":"e