{"id":"p4a_craipain_hnet_2024","title":"Bastien Craipain, review of Michel-Rolph Trouillot, Stirring the Pot of Haitian History, trans. and ed. Mariana Past and Benjamin Hebblethwaite (Liverpool: Liverpool University Press, 2021), H-Caribbean, H-Net Reviews (October 2024).","citation":"Bastien Craipain, review of Michel-Rolph Trouillot, Stirring the Pot of Haitian History, trans. and ed. Mariana Past and Benjamin Hebblethwaite (Liverpool: Liverpool University Press, 2021), H-Caribbean, H-Net Reviews (October 2024).","url":"https://www.h-net.org/reviews/showrev.php?id=60011","verification":{"status":"supporting_page_checked","checked_on":"2026-10-23","note":"Read in full for period-4 wave 1 (data/extension-2026/period4-wave1-2026-10-23/evidence-archive.md §13a), fetched with curl; quotes Silencing the Past, p. 98 (n. 3), the Liverpool edition's preface (p. xxiii) and afterword (p. 182); notes 1–8 read (Peck 2021; \"The Odd and the Ordinary\", Cimarrón 2:3, 1990; Dubois 2012; Daut 2021)."}}
{"id":"p4a_davidson_overland_2020","title":"Jared Davidson, \"Silencing the past: reflections on remembering and forgetting,\" Overland, 28 May 2020.","citation":"Jared Davidson, \"Silencing the past: reflections on remembering and forgetting,\" Overland, 28 May 2020.","url":"https://overland.org.au/2020/05/silencing-the-past-reflections-on-remembering-and-forgetting","verification":{"status":"supporting_page_checked","checked_on":"2026-10-23","note":"Open essay read (fetch summary) for period-4 wave 1 (data/extension-2026/period4-wave1-2026-10-23/evidence-archive.md §13b); it quotes chapter 1 of Silencing the Past without page numbers; used only for sentences marked \"as quoted by Davidson\", pending a library copy."}}
