DOI 10.1007/978-94-010-0570-8_2. **Abstract opening only** (Springer; "Unable to display preview"): "The term 'archives' first refers to a building, a symbol of a public institution"; "There cannot therefore be a definition of 'archives' that does not encompass both the building itself" (and, by the abstract's continuation, the documents it houses). Nothing else read.

