  (*Decolonization* 3:2, 2014, OA); Macoun and Strakosch, "The ethical demands of settler colonial theory"
  (*SCS* 3:3–4, 2013); Rowse, "Indigenous heterogeneity" (*AHS* 45:3, 2014); Englert, "Settlers, workers,
