p4b_perry_2015 https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9781139794701 bibliographic_metadata_checked Cambridge Core page read (dates 2 April and 5 May 2015; contents with page ranges, ch. 1 "Empire, family, and archive" 1–19 to ch. 9 "Conclusion: empire, colonies, and families" 254–263; shortlisted for the 2017 Sir John A. Macdonald Prize). The description (fetch summary) places the book in feminist scholarship on intimacy, critiques of colonial archives and the new imperial history. Unread.
